        <mxCell id="role_b" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;system-of-api-ci-role&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (system/ecr/of-api), &lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;prod01-us-of-api-ci-role&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; or &lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;prod01-usw2-of-api-ci-role&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (ci/roles in each region): whichever ARN the AWS_ROLE_ARN secret holds; each of those stacks writes it and the last apply wins. Trust: sub for of-api, ref refs/heads/master. Rights: ecr:GetAuthorizationToken, push and pull on ECR of-api only." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=46;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="acct">
