        <mxCell id="vault" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Outside this repository&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: the Vault JWT mount github-actions, the Vault roles opsfleet-plan and opsfleet-apply, both KV paths and the GitHub environment terraform." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="gate_a">
          <mxGeometry x="12" y="50" width="876" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="settings" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Actions settings Terraform writes, names only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;of-api: secrets AWS_ROLE_ARN, AWS_REGION, ECR_REPOSITORY (system/ecr/of-api); secret AWS_ROLE_ARN and variables AWS_REGION, DEPLOY_ENABLED, ECR_REPOSITORY (ci/github-actions in each region).&lt;br&gt;of-web: secrets AWS_ROLE_ARN, AWS_REGION, WEB_BUCKET, CLOUDFRONT_DISTRIBUTION_ID, ARTIFACT_BUCKET, ARTIFACT_PREFIX, SNYK_TOKEN and one per VITE_* build value (global/frontend).&lt;br&gt;of-helm: secret AWS_ROLE_ARN and variables AWS_REGION, DEPLOY_ENABLED, EKS_CLUSTER_NAME, K8S_NAMESPACE, ECR_REPOSITORY (ci/github-actions in each region; the us-west-2 stack runs only when applied by name).&lt;br&gt;of-load: secrets AWS_ROLE_ARN, AWS_REGION, ECR_REPOSITORY (system/ecr/of-load).&lt;br&gt;opsfleet: terraform.yml reads only the secret VAULT_ADDR, which no stack writes." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="acct">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1482" width="2880" height="106" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="launch" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;of-launch: deploy.yml&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Push to master or manual dispatch. Assumes the role in its OF_LAUNCH_CICD_ROLE secret through OIDC, pushes a linux/arm64 and linux/amd64 image to its ECR repository, uploads the bundle to its artifact bucket and deploys by CodeDeploy to one arm64 EC2 host. A separate infrastructure repository creates the role, the host and the CodeDeploy application." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=46;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1586" width="356" height="156" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
