        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="argo" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Argo CD&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, namespace argocd&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;prod01-us-east-1/cluster/eks/components: argocd, argocd-configuration&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repository Secret helm-repo: git over HTTPS with a username and read token from the sensitive variable helm_repo_credentials, whose value lives only in the git-ignored secrets file.&lt;br&gt;Sign-in: the built-in admin account with its generated initial secret; no SSO. UI at argocd.prod.innovate.example on the Ingress ALB, without a WAF." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="acct">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1656" width="640" height="116" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="apps" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;AppProject opsfleet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;argocd-configuration; app-services/example-api&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Destinations in this cluster: argocd, of, example-api, of-load.&lt;br&gt;Application of-api: charts/of-api into namespace of.&lt;br&gt;Application prod01-us-example-api: charts/example-api into namespace example-api.&lt;br&gt;Automated sync with prune and self-heal." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="acct">
