        <mxCell id="ctrl" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Controllers through EKS Pod Identity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;prod01-us-east-1/cluster/eks/components&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Karpenter, the EBS CSI driver, the AWS Load Balancer Controller and external-dns each assume their own IAM role; every role trusts pods.eks.amazonaws.com with sts:AssumeRole and sts:TagSession." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=46;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="acct">
